BT 1 0 0 1 0 39 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12 TL (The coherence decay function C = C_0 exp\(-alpha gamma_eff\) is not a new force, a new symmetry, or a new sector. It is a) Tj T* -0.0794 Tw (recognition that quantum systems measured under different conditions --- different gamma_eff --- yield different results. This) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.122864 Tw (is not exotic. It is quantum mechanics. What is new is the systematic application of this principle to cases where the field has) Tj T* 0 Tw (instead proposed new particles.) Tj T* ET
