BT 1 0 0 1 0 63 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12 TL (The muon interacts with the vacuum differently than the electron because it is a different-generation particle with different) Tj T* (coherence coupling. Neutrons confined in bottles decohere faster than neutrons in flight. Muonic hydrogen probes the) Tj T* (proton more harshly than electronic hydrogen. NaI crystals respond to cosmic ray modulation through their scintillation) Tj T* (coherence. MiniBooNE's mineral oil detector loses event coherence at low energies. These are not five different) Tj T* (phenomena requiring five different explanations. They are one phenomenon --- decoherence --- manifesting in five) Tj T* (experimental contexts.) Tj T* ET
