BT 1 0 0 1 0 39 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12 TL (The Standard Model is not wrong. It is incomplete. It lacks a coherence sector --- not a particle sector, but a recognition that) Tj T* (the vacuum has coherence structure, that this structure couples to matter generation-dependently, and that measurement) Tj T* (processes with different gamma_eff probe different aspects of it. The anomalies catalogued here are not threats to the) Tj T* (Standard Model. They are its coherence completion.) Tj T* ET
